  "title": "etoro to Acquire TradeZero to Accelerate US Expansion",
  "summary": "New York – August 11th, 2026 – etoro Group Ltd. (“etoro”, or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: ETOR), the trading and investing platform, announced today that it has entered into an agreement to acquire TradeZero, a US-focused online brokerage serving active traders. TradeZero is a highly complementary business that strengthens etoro’s presence in the US. Founded in 2015, TradeZero brings next generation trading platforms, global broker-dealer infrastructure, a highly…",
